#![cfg(unix)]
//! Deterministic `harness doctor` fixtures and read-only behavior proof (AI2-25 / #87)
//!
//! **Hermetic tests**: Every `doctor` invocation clears inherited environment and
//! controls PATH, HOME, CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR, HARNESS_BIN explicitly. Passing with
//! junk values exported proves no leakage.
//!
//! **Real fixtures**: Shims generated by `harness init`, not hand-written.
//!
//! **Strong read-only proofs**: Trap executables on PATH, filesystem state detects
//! content/mode/symlink changes and deletions, determinism asserts full stdout.
//!
//! ## Known Divergences from #87 (to be fixed in src/ follow-up)
//!
//! These three tests are flagged because current behavior contradicts #87:
//! 1. `missing_project_settings_divergence` - current: broken/2, spec: partial/1
//! 2. `modern_shim_with_obsolete_project_gate_off_divergence` - current: disabled/1, spec: ok/0
//! 3. `broken_manifest_and_enabled_switch_both_findings_divergence` - current: disabled/1, spec: broken/2
//!
//! ## Uncovered #87 Matrix Rows
//!
//! Deferred as infeasible or problematic for pure test-only pass:
//! - Switch permission error (unknown/1) - requires non-root EACCES injection
//! - Injected inspector error (error/3) - requires code hooks for failure injection
//! - Known legacy installer profiles - no legacy installer in tree to generate fixtures from
//! - FIFO input - causes test hangs; needs timeout handling
//! - Oversize manifest (>1 MiB) - doctor_collector MAX_FILE_SIZE enforcement needs verification
//!
//! ## Test Coverage (42 tests: 39 passing, 3 ignored)
//!
//! **Passing tests cover:**
//! - Modern init fixtures (additive, --grant, 0644 shim)
//! - All installation statuses (ok, partial, broken, disabled)
//! - Missing/invalid components (settings, hooks, shim, manifest, binary)
//! - Duplicate/conflicting registrations, invalid hooks shape
//! - Narrow matchers, fake/custom shims
//! - Kill switches (project/global/legacy, directory at switch path)
//! - Override validation (relative/nonexecutable HARNESS_BIN)
//! - Environment mismatches (CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR)
//! - Manifest edits (semantic vs formatting-only hashing)
//! - Different HOME/base roots
//! - Absent interpreter/claude on PATH
//! - Symlinks (loops, dangling, interpreter)
//! - Foreign binary (version unknown)
//! - Paths with spaces/quotes/metacharacters
//! - Strong read-only proofs (no traps invoked, no writes, deterministic output)
//! - Human/JSON mode consistency, clap vs diagnostic errors
//!
//! **Ignored tests (known divergences):**
//! - missing_project_settings_spec_expectation (spec: partial/1, current: broken/2)
//! - modern_shim_with_obsolete_project_gate_off_spec_expectation (spec: ok/0, current: disabled/1)
//! - broken_manifest_and_enabled_switch_both_findings_spec_expectation (spec: broken/2, current: disabled/1)

